### Why the CSD Code Is Important

Municipality names can differ slightly between datasets.

Examples could include:

```text
Whitchurch-Stouffville
Whitchurch Stouffville
Town of Whitchurch-Stouffville
```

Using only municipality names as a join key could therefore create inconsistencies.

The CSD identifier provides a more stable geographic key that can later be used to align:

* CMHC rent data
* CMHC vacancy data
* Statistics Canada census data
* income data
* shelter-cost data

The intended geographic key for the analytical model will therefore be:

```text
csd_code
```

with municipality name retained as a readable label.

