# 11. Data Governance Approach

The project follows three principles during data preparation.

### Preserve Raw Data

Raw source tables in:

```text
raw_cmhc
```

are not manually edited.

---

### Separate Cleaning From Analysis

The final architecture is intended to follow:

```text
raw data
   ↓
cleaned data
   ↓
analytical SQL views
   ↓
Power BI
```

---

### Preserve Source Metadata

Statistics Canada metadata tables will not be mixed directly into analytical observations.

Instead, relevant metadata will eventually be organized separately for:

* source documentation;
* reference periods;
* data definitions;
* footnotes;
* limitations;
* Power BI methodology documentation.

