# 12. Project Limitations Identified for Later Review

Several methodological issues still need to be resolved before KPI analysis begins.

### Household Income Definition

The current `11100009_gta` sample includes:

```text
Median total income, all families
```

The project KPI requires **median household income**.

These are not assumed to be interchangeable.

The correct Statistics Canada household-income measure will therefore be identified before the income dataset is cleaned.

---

### Income and Rent Reference Years

The planned analysis compares Census-era income data with newer CMHC rental data.

If historical income is adjusted to a later year's dollars, both values must be retained separately:

```text
nominal income
inflation-adjusted income
```

An inflation-adjusted historical value must not be described as observed income for the later year.

---

### CMHC Rental Coverage

CMHC rental-market data may not represent every type of rental housing.

This limitation will be documented in the final dashboard and methodology notes.

